@SafeVault.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5156

### Create a user
POST {{SafeVault.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/CreateUser?username=alice&email=alice%40example.com
Accept: application/json

###

### Get a user
GET {{SafeVault.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/johndavid
Accept: application/json
### Get a user
GET {{SafeVault.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/alice' OR '1'='1
Accept: application/json